            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Online donation processing is handled through PBS, and this site does not collect payment information. A mailed check supports NJ PBS but does not activate PBS Passport; to start or renew Passport streaming, donate through the new donation portal."
